{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-85593-r4518670","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Portuguese Feijoada","sourcePageId":85593,"sourceRevision":"4518670","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T16:31:41Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Portuguese%20Feijoada&oldid=4518670","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:20:28.261Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Boiled recipes","Category:Gluten-free recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Portuguese recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for stew","Category:Recipes using beef","Category:Recipes using black bean","Category:Recipes using carrot","Category:Recipes using garlic","Category:Recipes using margarine","Category:Recipes using meat","Category:Recipes using pork","Category:Recipes using rice","Category:Recipes using vegetable oil","Category:Recipes with metric units"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"f0ac3ea73ded7336daf9a6cd6a29d5d568240bc87f2c15605345d6afd5e5894d","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary\n| Category = Bean recipes\n| Servings = 10\n| Time = 2 hours (not including soaking time)\n| Rating = 3\n| Energy = \n| Difficulty = 3\n| Image = \n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of Portugal|Portuguese Cuisine]]\n\n'''Portuguese feijoada''' is a type of bean, pork, and beef [[Cookbook:stew|stew]].\n\n== Ingredients ==\n\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Liter|litre]] dried [[Cookbook:Black Bean|black beans]]\n* Assorted [[Cookbook:Meat and Poultry|meat]] of personal choice (universally it is pork knee, pork sausage, and salted dry beef)\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Bay Leaf|bay leaves]]\n* 1 branch [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]], [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Onion|onions]], chopped\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tomato|tomato]], [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Carrot|carrots]], diced\n* 2 crushed [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]] cloves\n* 4 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Vegetable Oil|vegetable oil]]\n* [[Cookbook:Margarine|Margarine]]\n* 1 can [[Cookbook:Tomato Paste|tomato paste]]\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n* [[Cookbook:Pepper|Pepper]]\n* [[Cookbook:Paprika|Paprika]]\n* 1¼ [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] (600 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) [[Cookbook:Rice|rice]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# [[Cookbook:Soaking Beans|Soak]] beans for several hours, then put them in a large [[Cookbook:Saucepan|saucepan]].\n# Add all the meat to pot.\n# Add bay leaves and chopped parsley.\n# Fill the pot with water and bring to [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]].\n# [[Cookbook:Frying|Fry]] onions, tomatoes, carrots, and garlic in oil and margarine.\n# Once onions are fried, transfer two ladle scoops of bean mixture into skillet, mash with vegetables, then dump all contents of skillet back into pot.\n# Mix in tomato paste, cover, and let cook for 1 hour. Season with salt, pepper, and paprika to taste.\n# Cook rice separately and, when finished, add to pot, then serve.\n\n[[Category:Portuguese recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pork]]\n[[Category:Recipes using beef]]\n[[Category:Recipes using meat]]\n[[Category:Recipes using black bean]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rice]]\n[[Category:Recipes for stew]]\n[[Category:Boiled recipes]]\n[[Category:Gluten-free recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vegetable oil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Portuguese Feijoada","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":"10","ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 litre dried black beans","sourceText":"1 litre dried black beans","amountText":"1 litre dried black beans","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"Assorted meat of personal choice (universally it is pork knee, pork sausage, and salted dry beef)","sourceText":"Assorted meat of personal choice (universally it is pork knee, pork sausage, and salted dry beef)","amountText":"Assorted meat of personal choice (universally it is pork knee, pork sausage, and salted dry beef)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 bay leaves","sourceText":"2 bay leaves","amountText":"2 bay leaves","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 branch parsley, chopped","sourceText":"1 branch parsley, chopped","amountText":"1 branch parsley, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"3 onions, chopped","sourceText":"3 onions, chopped","amountText":"3 onions, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 tomato, diced","sourceText":"1 tomato, diced","amountText":"1 tomato, diced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"3 carrots, diced","sourceText":"3 carrots, diced","amountText":"3 carrots, diced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"2 crushed garlic cloves","sourceText":"2 crushed garlic cloves","amountText":"2 crushed garlic cloves","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"4 tbsp vegetable oil","sourceText":"4 tbsp vegetable oil","amountText":"4 tbsp vegetable oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"M